{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">德國多個城市有民眾發起反極右另類選擇黨示威。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.GER.PROTEST-0530.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/202604d3CaCxbO1789253453.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.GER.PROTEST-0530.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">德國百多個組織、團體組成的跨黨派聯盟，周六在首都柏林、慕尼黑、漢堡等超過30個城市，發起反極右另類選擇黨示威，其中在柏林的示威有過萬人參加。有示威者表示，需要極度關注另類選擇黨在東部地方議會選舉獲勝，反對極右勢力的人應該團結一致，求同存異，捍衛自由民主。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.GER.PROTEST-0530_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026CExOGjeDZe1789253214.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.GER.PROTEST-0530_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">亦有示威者正發動一場名為「檢視」的運動，促請當局研究是否可以取締另類選擇黨。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T23:05:56.462679+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}